cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "TinyACE: Agentic Context Engineering for Small Language Models"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Shahi
    given-names: Suryodaya
  - name: Sathwik
  - name: Archit
repository-code: "https://github.com/SirAlchemist1/edge-slm-ace"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  A framework for evaluating whether small language models can self-improve
  without fine-tuning, by maintaining a token-budgeted playbook of
  domain-specific strategies that is retrieved, scored and evicted across a
  Generate-Reflect-Curate-Memorize loop.
keywords:
  - small language models
  - edge inference
  - context engineering
  - agentic memory
